     ],
     "text": "Blue Trainer Bellows Drill"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b3",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "Blue Trainer Bellows Drill",
     "hash": "231b91528493eaf149dfc87d",
     "box": [
      72,
      121.4,
      461.6,
      26.4
     ],
     "text": "Protocol RT-TRAIN-014 · Revision 2 · Effective 1 November 2026 · Issued by the Lakeside Training Hospital Respiratory Education Committee (a fictional body)."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b4",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "e015fceaf4246d1d2f340ad8",
     "box": [
      72,
      164.3,
      215.3,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "Summary of changes in Revision 2"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b5",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "Summary of changes in Revision 2",
     "hash": "63609e1b957cf80a994b9192",
     "box": [
      72,
      188.4,
      465.1,
      40.4
     ],
     "text": "The adult starting rate and highest rate are raised. The pediatric recheck is shortened. The servicing interval is lengthened. The Charge Educator replaces the Simulation Lead as the person who issues the drill order and the first person to call."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b6",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "cfb137e08bf1c969ff218611",
     "box": [
      72,
      245.3,
      66.5,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "1. Purpose"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b7",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "1. Purpose",
     "hash": "2e71e2c3afc395a6db3fda80",
     "box": [
      72,
      269.4,
      466.3,
      40.4
     ],
     "text": "This invented protocol exists only to test Department Hub. It describes a classroom drill on the Blue Trainer bellows, a device that does not exist. Rates are counted in marks per minute (mk/min), a unit made up for this document."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b8",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "26c8c88741023591c41cc9ff",
     "box": [
      72,
      326.3,
      147.4,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "2. Who may run the drill"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b9",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "2. Who may run the drill",
     "hash": "873ceab3308aa4d609b13982",
     "box": [
      72,
      350.4,
      456.9,
      26.4
     ],
     "text": "Only a therapist who holds a current Blue Trainer card may run the drill. A student may run the drill only while a card holder is present in the room."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b10",
     "kind": "heading",
     "under": null,
     "hash": "e0bbd8c576dc461a64dfad41",
     "box": [
      72,
      393.3,
      76.6,
      15.3
     ],
     "text": "3. Drill order"
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b11",
     "kind": "text",
     "under": "3. Drill order",
     "hash": "4cd64c9e73330c83926a8643",
     "box": [
      72,
      417.4,
      460.4,
      26.4
     ],
     "text": "A written drill order from the Charge Educator is required before the drill is started. A verbal request is not a drill order."
    },
    {
     "anchor": "p1.b12",
     "kind": "text",
     "running": true,
     "under": null,
     "hash": "399c66e39923afd28901b85a",
     "box": [
      72,
      745.4,
      184,
      9.4
     ],
     "text": "Synthetic test material — NOT FOR CLINICAL USE"
    },
